# First start

## Step 1 : Build and start docker in dev config

From `vidjil/docker`

```bash
make build_and_run_dev
```

Or more manually

```bash
ln -s docker-compose-dev.yml docker-compose.override.yml
make build-client build-server
docker compose up -d
```

## Step 2 (optional) : Load data

Either initialize with default test data :

```bash
make reset-database
```

Or load backup `.sql` file

```bash
cp backup.sql vidjil/docker/volumes/vidjil/mysql/
docker exec -it vidjil-mysql bash
mysql -u vidjil -p vidjil < /var/lib/mysql/backup.sql
```

## Step 3 : Load dev test websites

- [Vidjil](https://localhost)
- [Dashboard](https://localhost/_dashboard)
- [Flower (Celery monitoring tool)](https://localhost:5555)
